---
// src/components/SoftwareSolutions.astro
---

<!-- Full Stack Software Development Deep Dive Section -->
<section class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 dark:from-blue-900/10 dark:to-cyan-900/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Content -->
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-100 to-cyan-100 dark:from-blue-900/30 dark:to-cyan-900/30 rounded-full mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">FULL STACK DEVELOPMENT</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-8 text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-[1.1]">
          Custom Software That Scales Your Business
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Your business is unique—your software should be too.</span> We build custom web and mobile applications using modern frameworks and cloud-native architectures that scale with your growth.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:to-cyan-900/20 rounded-xl p-6 border border-blue-200/50 dark:border-blue-700/30">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Modern Tech Stack Expertise</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              From React, Next.js, and TypeScript on the frontend to Node.js, Python, and Go on the backend—we leverage cutting-edge technologies to build fast, reliable, and maintainable applications. Our DevOps expertise ensures smooth deployments and rock-solid infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Rapid Prototyping to Production</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Launch MVPs in weeks, not months. Our agile development process validates ideas quickly, gathers user feedback, and iterates toward product-market fit. Then we scale from prototype to enterprise-grade platform seamlessly.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Cloud-Native Architecture</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Deploy on AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure with containerized microservices, auto-scaling infrastructure, and CI/CD pipelines. We design for reliability, security, and performance from day one—handling everything from database optimization to load balancing.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">API-First Development</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Build extensible platforms with RESTful and GraphQL APIs. Integrate seamlessly with third-party services, enable mobile and web clients, and create ecosystems of interconnected applications that drive business value.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Software Development Impact Metrics -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl border border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-600/30">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-center">Development Impact Metrics</h3>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">10+</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Years Experience</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Full stack development</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl font-black text-cyan-600 mb-2">100%</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Cloud Native</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Modern infrastructure</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">6-12</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Week MVP</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Rapid time-to-market</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl font-black text-cyan-600 mb-2">24/7</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">Uptime Focus</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Production reliability</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tech Stack Highlights -->
          <div class="border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-600 pt-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 text-center">Technology Expertise</h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mr-3"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">React & Next.js</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full mr-3"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Node.js & Python</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mr-3"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">AWS & Azure</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full mr-3"></span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">PostgreSQL & MongoDB</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Expert Insight -->
          <div class="mt-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:to-cyan-900/20 rounded-xl p-4 border border-blue-200/50 dark:border-blue-700/30">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-2">Expert Insight:</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              "The best software solutions combine technical excellence with business understanding. We build what you need, not what's trendy—delivering real value through clean code and thoughtful architecture."
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">— Senior Software Architect, HilBar Consulting</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
